{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.2be231dbbf7a5f4d55ec8629.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The selected control evaluates applicability of the announced exemption, conditional on underlying regime scope; it does not determine independent legal force or overall compliance.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.2be231dbbf7a5f4d55ec8629.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The commencement date is inclusive and evaluated at the assessment date.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.2be231dbbf7a5f4d55ec8629.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Alignment describes the policy approach and does not incorporate every overseas qualification.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.2be231dbbf7a5f4d55ec8629.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Unknown underlying scope and later-notice facts remain unknown.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"df2da07cb5a0d081f3b3d131e21d0dd788c265dabe4e03a31b4bebeb89934f9e","candidate_id":"candidate.fecdcd9adc3f4db69123f4d9671d3395","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Selected control: applicability of the announced SFC equity-options margin exemption. Within the declared actor and underlying margin-regime scope, true means the transaction is a listed non-centrally cleared equity option, the assessment date is on or after 2026-01-04, and no effective further notice has displaced reliance on this announcement for it. False means at least one condition fails; it does not establish a margin breach or rule out another exemption. Outside scope the control makes no determination. Unknown inputs remain unknown. EU reporting, insignificant exposure and case-officer consultation are not added as eligibility conditions.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["exceptions"],"generation_phase":"SHARED_RESOLUTION","issue_ids":[],"parent_id":"candidate.b31583a76b5f4e47825b4f42f72e1da0","probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason